# The 16 TB4 tasks of dsv41-flash-tb4-overfit16.yaml, one instance_id per line (the source of
# truth). From Run 4 (dsv41-tb4-pass4-2): every trial stayed <= 256k context except one
# fin-saccr-rwa trial at 268k. Note per task: Run 4 solves of 4, peak context.
# The prompt file is derived from Run 4's prompt file, keeping only these tasks' rows:
#   python3 -c 'import json,sys; ids={l.split()[0] for l in open(sys.argv[1]) if l.strip() and l[0]!="#"}; \
#     [sys.stdout.write(r) for r in open(sys.argv[2]) if json.loads(r)["metadata"]["instance_id"] in ids]' \
#     dsv41-flash-tb4-overfit16.tasks $MILES_DATA/prompts/tb4_cpu52.jsonl > $MILES_DATA/prompts/tb4_overfit16.jsonl
